\newlabel{fig:gaussian-heter}{{S12}{59}{Average performance of the proposed TSCP method and alternative conformal prediction approaches on simulated data with $d=10$ outcome variables and heterogeneous noise variances. The target coverage level is $90\%$. TSCP consistently attains near-nominal coverage while producing the smallest prediction sets on average. Numerical results and corresponding standard deviations are reported in Table~\ref {tab:gaussian-heter}}{figure.caption.28}{}}
